Package: cigamingos-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CiGaming <admin@snugglesmp.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: cigamingos-branding (= @VERSION@), cigamingos-tools (= @VERSION@),
 kde-plasma-desktop, sddm, plasma-nm, plasma-pa, bluedevil, kscreen, powerdevil,
 konsole, dolphin, kate, ark, gwenview, okular, kde-spectacle, kcalc, partitionmanager,
 firefox-esr, vlc,
 pipewire, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, pipewire-alsa,
 network-manager, flatpak, plasma-discover, plasma-discover-backend-flatpak,
 fonts-noto, fonts-noto-color-emoji, fonts-dejavu,
 plymouth, plymouth-themes,
 cups, system-config-printer, avahi-daemon,
 curl, wget, git, htop, unzip, p7zip-full, pciutils, usbutils,
 cigamingos-welcome (= @VERSION@), polkit-kde-agent-1
Recommends: open-vm-tools-desktop, qemu-guest-agent, spice-vdagent,
 obs-studio, v4l2loopback-dkms, linux-headers-amd64, kdenlive, audacity, krita,
 kdeconnect, ffmpeg, yt-dlp, fastfetch,
 firmware-linux, firmware-misc-nonfree, firmware-iwlwifi, firmware-realtek, firmware-amd-graphics
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: CiGaming OS desktop (streaming + community edition)
 The full CiGaming OS desktop: KDE Plasma with the CiGaming look,
 PipeWire audio, Flatpak/Flathub, and a streaming toolkit — OBS Studio
 with virtual camera support, Kdenlive, Audacity and Krita.
 .
 Discord and Prism Launcher are installed from Flathub on first boot.
 .
 VMware and QEMU/Proxmox guest tools are included; on real hardware
 they stay idle.
